cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this feasibility research, please cite this repository."
title: "URLC Feasibility Research"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Nikolaev"
    given-names: "Shteryan"
abstract: >-
  An archival feasibility investigation into a proposed lossless, locally
  decodable representation of HTTP(S) URLs for QR use. Research was suspended
  at Gate 1 because available evidence did not establish a sufficiently
  significant unmet need. No codec, URI scheme, or proof of concept was built.
keywords:
  - QR code
  - URL
  - URI
  - feasibility research
  - technology assessment
  - negative results
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: 0.1.0
